# Slack notifications

Required env: `SLACK_BOT_TOKEN`, `SLACK_TEAM_ID`.

## Operations

<!-- Harness scaffold: integration=slack -->

- Post message → `mcp__slack__postMessage` with channel + blocks
- Reply → `mcp__slack__postReply` to thread
- File upload → `mcp__slack__filesUpload` for screenshots / artefacts

